Package: ultimate-vocal-remover
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Maicom Ferreira <maicomferre@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, ffmpeg, rubberband-cli, xdg-utils, libx11-6, libxcb1
Homepage: https://github.com/maicomferre/ultimatevocalremovergui
Description: community-maintained Linux build of Ultimate Vocal Remover GUI
 Ultimate Vocal Remover uses neural network models to separate vocals and
 instruments from audio. This package provides the community-maintained CPU
 runtime for Debian-based Linux distributions.
 .
 This is not an official release by the original UVR developers. The original
 project and credits are preserved in the installed documentation.
